          <h1>Goally vs. iPad: What if a tablet could teach more than apps?</h1>
          <p class="intro">Some of childhood’s biggest milestones are surprisingly small: brushing teeth without reminders, getting ready for school, naming a feeling or finishing a routine. We love the idea of technology that helps children practice those moments.</p>
          <p class="rating"><strong>9.3/10</strong> <span>BUY BETTER FINDS EDITORIAL PICK<br/>Best for focused early learning & independence</span></p>
